<title>USA: Capstone Capital ups qtly div to $0.475.</title>
<headline>Capstone Capital ups qtly div to $0.475.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capstone Capital Corp increased its quarterly dividend to $0.475, up $0.005 from its previous quarterly dividend of $0.47.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on August 15, 1997 to shareholders of record on August 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Capstone is a real-estate investment trust (REIT) which owns, leases and provides mortgage financing for healthcare-related properties.</p>
